                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The orphne fixes their chilling gaze on a living creature within 60 feet, terrifying a potential victim and draining its will to fight. The target must attempt a @Check[will|dc:22] save; if already enfeebled, the target takes a –2 circumstance penalty to its save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is frightened 1 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1} for as long as it remains frightened.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2}.</p>"
